ive real numbers. Therefore, $-\\sqrt{25}$ does not belong to $\\mathbb{R}^{+}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{-}$ contains the nonpositive rational numbers. Therefore, $-\\sqrt{25}$ belongs to $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{-}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Z}$ contains all integers. Therefore, $-\\sqrt{25}$ belongs to $\\mathbb{Z}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Q}$ contains all rational numbers. Therefore, $-\\sqrt{25}$ belongs to $\\mathbb{Q}$.\n\nTherefore, select $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{-}$, $\\mathbb{Z}$, $\\mathbb{Q}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186624696 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c596f89-4808-5215-ad23-c0d60d4228cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624678} {:answer/id #uuid "57e09251-ce8d-50a4-ae5d-2df4de6ebfd1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624691}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1c596f89-4808-5215-ad23-c0d60d4228cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624678} :answer-field/id #uuid "182d2acc-f468-52c4-a3d6-9cf8c5ccd4d5" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{R}_0^{-}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624677} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46d56a28-9931-53e4-a27b-9f556f292f98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624688} {:answer/id #uuid "c83f43a9-0236-5a74-9a5a-65b3c9d10661" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624717}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c83f43a9-0236-5a74-9a5a-65b3c9d10661" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624717} :answer-field/id #uuid "2885f085-326b-55a9-ac0d-75757ff7e300" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{Q}^{-}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624681} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uui