given class but not in $\\mathbb{Z}$. Therefore, this set does not contain all the real numbers.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Q}^{-}$ contains the negative rational numbers. For instance, $1$ is in the given class but not in $\\mathbb{Q}^{-}$. Therefore, this set does not contain all the real numbers.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{R}_0^{-}$ contains the nonpositive real numbers. For instance, $1$ is in the given class but not in $\\mathbb{R}_0^{-}$. Therefore, this set does not contain all the real numbers.\n\nTherefore, select none of the sets; leave every box unchecked."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186624716 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02b4c276-acb1-5d8a-94ef-d87e46aafb4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624666} {:answer/id #uuid "16b6b1bf-2448-51d2-bde4-c769ae4a4b26" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624676}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16b6b1bf-2448-51d2-bde4-c769ae4a4b26" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624676} :answer-field/id #uuid "e1fd2c2d-d6de-5db5-9476-1e3ef060b2da" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{Q}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624719} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0951f355-f617-53c5-9c1c-e8a6bd833a6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624669} {:answer/id #uuid "815cb232-e680-50c6-b4ba-34d32aeb032e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624704}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "815cb232-e680-50c6-b4ba-34d32aeb032e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624704} :answer-field/id #uuid "e3c922da-a959-5376-bc48-006e912a7029" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{R}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624720} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "586a9db5-46fa-537f-a5f8-2b8c24442360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624692} {:answer/id #uuid "ab61ec59-c316-5197-9c30-fc67c5fa3e4d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624712}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "586a9db5-46fa-537f-a5f8-2b8c24442360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624692} :answer-field/id #uuid "e7288dd3-d853-5c47-9699-691b00a2f5ce" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{Z}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624721} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ad7a74c-ef53-5710-9f82-a8aad9965b75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624684} {:answer/id #uuid "a92e0627-2e68-588d-9eaa-2a8c231ef551" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624711}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a92e0627-2e68-588d-9eaa-2a8c231ef551" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624711} :answer-field/id #uuid "fc3716d7-04a2-5389-9da9-eaccd9006882" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{C}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186624729}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c555e324-72f5-52a6-b605-665b3e814810" :question/problem "To which of the following sets do all the integers belong?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "We must check whether each set contains all the integers.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Q}$ contains all rational numbers. By the number-set hierarchy and the sign restrictions, every member of the given class belongs to $\\mathbb{Q}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{C}$ contains all complex numbers. By the number-set hierarchy and the sign restrictions, every member of the given class belongs to $\\mathbb{C}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{Z}$ contains all integers. By the number-set hierarchy and the sign restrictions, every member of the given class belongs to $\\mathbb{Z}$.\n\n- The set $\\mathbb{R}$ contains all real numbers. By the number-set hierarchy and the sign restrictions, every member of the given class belongs to $\\mathbb{R}$.\n\nTherefore, select $\\mathbb{Q}$, $\\mathbb{C}$, $\\mathbb{Z}$, $\\mathbb{R}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186637243 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0463727d-67b7-5240-918a-1253d4d97b73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186636683} {:answer/id #uuid "1c9b4af0-c07e-5a98-9b1d-06ea88bcc2cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186636720} {:answer/id #uuid "4f4a2b21-1def-5e4d-b322-f185576dd54c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186636802} {:answer/id #uuid "a4eafb5b-7583-5840-a7f6-423254f88878" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186636955} {:answer/id #uuid "c1ef4b04-17c3-5c74-95a2-58d06296fab2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "None" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637009}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0463727d-67b7-5240-918a-1253d4d97b73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186636683} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a8dbd68-de0b-5060-9d10-02291443a54f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637119}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "17cf8bd5-1b50-5ea6-9196-c8cc3bb865c7" :question/math-academy-id "q-36246" :question/problem "To which of the following sets do all the negative integers belong?\n\nI. $Z$\n\nII. ${Z}^{+}$\n\nIII. ${Q}^{+}$\n\nIV. ${Q}^{-}$" :question/worked-solution "The negative integers are $-1,-2,-3,…$\n\n- Since all negative integers are integer numbers, all the negative integers belong to $Z.$ $\\,✓$\n\n- The set ${Z}^{+}$ contains all the positive integer numbers. However, negative integer numbers as, for instance, $-2$ don't belong to ${Z}^{+},$ so ${Z}^{+}$ does *not* contain the negative integer numbers. $\\,\\times$\n\n- The set ${Q}^{+}$ contains all the positive rational numbers. However, negative integer numbers as, for instance, $-2$ don't belong to ${Q}^{+},$ so ${Q}^{+}$ does *not* contain the negative integer numbers. $\\,\\times$\n\n- Since all the negative integer numbers are negative rational numbers, all the negative integer numbers belong to ${Q}^{-}.$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and IV only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186673805 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a08ed5a-fb0e-590b-a170-711acc6f362c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673793} {:answer/id #uuid "4acda401-7c87-54d8-91f3-6b1d8af4d6a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673810}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4acda401-7c87-54d8-91f3-6b1d8af4d6a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673810} :answer-field/id #uuid "83acefd7-210a-5a8e-9a66-8ce00782f750" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbb{R}_0^{+}$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673819} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7145b263-2983-5d6a-ac91-2a4926de5863" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673814} {:answer/id #uuid "bfa488c3-116a-530a-b654-f1bb60d58270" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673829}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id 